3. **Gardena** - If you prefer a more modern approach to irrigation, the Gardena Smart Water Control could be the right choice. Its compatibility with HomeKit and Alexa allows for seamless integration into your home network, while its ability to adapt to changing weather conditions ensures efficient water distribution. Plus, with 36 cycles per day and frost alerts, this device offers excellent functionality for connected gardeners.
